'''God blessings''' can be found as a reward from all levels of [[Treasure Trails]], except [[Clue scroll (beginner)|beginner]]. Each God blessing comes colour coded to represent their respective gods. [[Saradomin]] is blue, [[Guthix]] is green, [[Zamorak]] is red, [[Armadyl]] is silver, [[Zaros]] is purple, and [[Bandos]] is brown.

Each god blessing has a +1 [[prayer bonus]] in the ammunition slot, and will also provide protection within the [[God Wars Dungeon]] (excluding the peaceful blessing).

